invalid type: string "## 17. SCIENTIFIC IMPORTANCE\n\nVenus is often described as Earth's planetary neighbor and a geological comparison case.\nIts similar size to Earth makes the difference in climate especially significant.\nVenus demonstrates the effects of an extreme greenhouse atmosphere.\nIts atmosphere provides a natural laboratory for studying dense planetary atmospheres.\npÿ?Nÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ